    "description": "Find the person's published apps, including apps whose origin chat was deleted. Query matches name or folder. Server localUrl is on the app's hosting computer; call it there with curl or fetch, using the app's README for its API. app_start and app_stop control server lifetime; tab_close only removes a tab.",
    "input": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
